                "source": "Another lists ₹6-18.3 LPA for the same title.",
                "text": "Another lists ₹6-18.3 LPA for the same title."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "short-answer",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 1,
            "supporting": [
              "People search \"career after MBA\", \"career opportunities after MBA\", or \"MBA careers\" and get the same list of ten job titles with salary ranges that disagree with each other. One popular site lists investment banker pay at Rs 3-60 LPA. Another lists Rs 6-18.3 LPA for the same title."
            ]
          },
          {
            "needId": "proof:2",
            "type": "proof",
            "heading": "Led By Growth Headroom",
            "kind": "figures",
            "figures": [
              {
                "value": "3-5 years",
                "label": "Estimated Time Required",
                "source": "Watch out: Almost entirely a top-institute door at entry. Below that tier it opens after 3-5 years, usually from a strong industry seat.",
                "text": "Watch out: Almost entirely a top-institute door at entry. Below that tier it opens after 3-5 years, usually from a strong industry seat."
              },
              {
                "value": "18-24 month",
                "label": "Estimated Time Required",
                "source": "Fast-growing but selective. Associate product manager roles run 18-24 month rotations, and Instahyre 2025-26 hiring data puts typical APM pay at Rs 12-22 LPA. Business analyst and analytics roles are a wider door.",
                "text": "Fast-growing but selective. Associate product manager roles run 18-24 month rotations, and Instahyre 2025-26 hiring data puts typical APM pay at Rs 12-22 LPA. Business analyst and analytics roles are a wider door."
              },
              {
                "value": "₹12-22 LPA",
                "label": "Typical Salary Range",
                "source": "Fast-growing but selective. Associate product manager roles run 18-24 month rotations, and Instahyre 2025-26 hiring data puts typical APM pay at Rs 12-22 LPA. Business analyst and analytics roles are a wider door.",
                "text": "Fast-growing but selective."
              },
              {
                "value": "₹1.55 lakh",
                "label": "Monthly Pay Allowance",
                "source": "A separate exam-led door. RBI Grade B 2026 had 60 posts (40 general) and a gross pay of about Rs 1.55 lakh a month before housing allowance. SEBI Grade A (notified October 2025, exams held in 2026) had 110 posts, 56 in the general stream, and its general stream asks for a two-year master's degree or PGDM, which an MBA meets.",
                "text": "A separate exam-led door. RBI Grade B 2026 had 60 posts (40 general) and a gross pay of about Rs 1.55 lakh a month before housing allowance. SEBI Grade A (notified October 2025, exams held in 2026) had 110 posts, 56 in the general stream, and its general stream asks for a two-year master's degree or PGDM, which an MBA meets."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "lane-map",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "needId": "proof:8",
            "type": "proof",
            "heading": "What Hiring Data Says Right Now",
            "kind": "figures",
            "figures": [
              {
                "value": "₹29 LPA",
                "label": "Typical Salary Range",
                "source": "Pay at the top is flat to slightly lower. IIM Indore's average fell from Rs 29.57 lakh (2023-25) to about Rs 27.3 lakh (2024-26), about 8%, although the batch mix may differ. XLRI's median held at Rs 29 LPA while its highest domestic offer dropped from Rs 75 lakh to Rs 59 lakh.",
                "text": "Pay at the top is flat to slightly lower. IIM Indore's average fell from Rs 29.57 lakh (2023-25) to about Rs 27.3 lakh (2024-26), about 8%, although the batch mix may differ. XLRI's median held at Rs 29 LPA while its highest domestic offer dropped from Rs 75 lakh to Rs 59 lakh."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "market-now",
